Modkeel lab data

game/resources/modkeel/rules.tsv holds results from the Modkeel lab: which exact mod files
(by SHA-1) ran or crashed on which Minecraft version, and which mods ran together or clash.
The Companion jars ship it to explain their diagnoses offline.

